// expect: refuse E_TypeMismatch
// A stage with no hole: `f(2, 3)` is already a complete call, so the pipe
// has no field to fill with its datum. The pipe's one rule — the stage meets
// a one-parameter function by unification — refuses it as the type mismatch
// it is; no class of its own names the shape.
fn f(a, b) = a + b

fn main() = 1 |> f(2, 3)
